  <diagram id="evaluation-methodology-f01-evidence-boundary" name="Cache evidence is not a timing or area result" ecgTitle="Cache evidence is not a timing or area result" ecgDescription="The plate separates current cache_sim results from the pending Scale6 gem5 implementation and physical-cost evidence. Demand misses, prefetch traffic, writebacks and P-OPT matrix traffic are distinct accounting terms. Acceptance requires matching PageRank results and bounded active mechanisms. The single-epoch baseline is labeled as a reconstruction.">
